Build your own treasure zoo, in three easy steps and one difficult 
one:

1. Start a game and notice that you have a potion of confusion (or 
non-blessed booze), scrolls of taming and create monster, and a wand 
of polymorph. (Er, this is the difficult step.)

2. Read confusion and create a bunch of acid blobs. Surround yourself 
by as many as possible (hopefully eight) and tame them. Kill the other 
few so they don't get in the way.

3. Keep lining up the acid blobs and polying them until you have a 
satisfactory zoo. Minotaurs, demiliches, and other high-level 
creatures are recommended, as long as you take proper care of them and 
don't leave them lying around on some high level to attack you later.

4. Convert your zoo into a treasure zoo by leading it on a rampage 
through Minetown. Collect the gold. Smile.

